(SECTION 3: INDIAN AVIATION & FULL MANUAL OVERVIEW) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(MILESTONES IN INDIAN AVIATION:) Tj
T*
(  * 1932: J.R.D. Tata pilots the first historic commercial flight from Karachi to Bombay.) Tj
T*
(  * 1953: Air Corporations Act nationalizes domestic airlines into Indian Airlines & Air India.) Tj
T*
(  * 1994: Air Corporation Repeal Act opens skies to scheduled private carriers.) Tj
T*
(  * Today: India is the 3rd largest and fastest growing domestic civil aviation market.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(WHAT THE FULL AIRBORNE USER MANUAL & COURSE COVERS:) Tj
T*
(  [Module 1] Aviation Fundamentals & Aircraft Familiarisation \(A320 / B737 layouts\)) Tj
T*
(  [Module 2] Personal Grooming, Skin/Hair Care & Airline Uniform Etiquette) Tj
T*
(  [Module 3] Public Speaking, Voice Modulation & In-Flight PA Briefings) Tj
T*
(  [Module 4] Safety Equipment, Fire-fighting & Mock Evacuation Drills) Tj
T*
(  [Module 5] First Aid, CPR, Choking & In-Flight Medical Emergencies) Tj
T*
(  [Module 6] World-class Hospitality, VIP Handling & Conflict De-escalation) Tj
T*
(  [Module 7] Group Discussion \(GD\), Personal Interview \(PI\) & Airline Mock Selection) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Enrollment / Scholarship queries: admissions@airborneaviation.in | +91 9953 777 320) Tj
